<title>USA: Leslie's Poolmart sells $90 mln 144A debt.</title>
<headline>Leslie's Poolmart sells $90 mln 144A debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A debt issue from Leslie's Poolmart Inc was priced on Friday via BT Securities Corp, according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>Leslie's Poolmart Inc is a specialty retailer.</p>
<p>BORROWER LESLIE'S POOLMART INC.</p>
<p>AMT $90 MLN</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES</p>
<p>MATURITY 7/15/04</p>
<p>COUPON 10-3/8 PCT</p>
<p>ISS PRICE 100</p>
<p>YIELD 10-3/8 PCT</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS</p>
<p>FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>CALL FEATURE NON CALL FOUR</p>
<p>NOTE:Three year equity call for $25 million at 110.375.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678)</p>
</text>
